## Phase 5: Prompt Processing System (COMPLETED)

Status: Completed

Goals:
  Create root-level prompts/ inbox and integrate with /sdd command.
  Prompts are analyzed, formalized in .sdd/projects/prompts/,
  documented in .sdd/projects/{project_name}/docs/prompts/, and approved by human
  before flow-based planning begins.

Deliverables:
  - prompts/ folder at root level (user inbox)
  - .sdd/projects/prompts/ (formalized examples)
  - .sdd/projects/{project_name}/docs/prompts/ (documented prompts with IDs)
  - Prompt folder structure and workflow
  - First skill in each prompt folder
  - Updated /sdd command to read from prompts/
  - Prompt lifecycle (inbox -> active -> archive)
  - .gitignore with .sdd/
  - Example prompts (payment, auth)

Files Created: 5+

